      "message": "[error] Line 569: 🔴 `.reply` permission check is too broad: `textReply || fileReply` allows replying to file messages when only text-reply permission is granted (and vice versa). This weakens the permission boundary for message actions. Gate reply by both the menu item and message type (e.g., text menu requires `.textReply`, file-transfer menu requires `.fileReply`) so each capability is enforced independently.",
